 "The built card — original files are not changed": "生成的卡片——原文件不会被修改",
 "The console is on and on the same network. In sleep mode FTP does not answer.": "主机已开机并处于同一网络。待机状态下 FTP 不会响应。",
 "The console is on, awake and on the same network. The screen may be off, but the console must be running.": "主机已开机、未休眠，并处于同一网络。屏幕可以是关着的，但主机必须在运行。",
 "The console shows its own address — on PS3 it is printed by webMAN, on Switch the server puts it on screen. The password is kept next to the collection and is never shown.": "主机会自己显示地址——PS3 上由 webMAN 给出，Switch 上由服务器显示在屏幕上。密码保存在收藏旁边，永远不会显示出来。",
 "The file on the console is not changed — a copy is saved": "主机上的文件不会被修改——保存的是一份副本",
 "The ftpsrv FTP server is running, and specifically as a sysmodule (switch_sysmod), not the app: the app runs only while the homebrew menu is open, and closes together with it.": "FTP 服务器 ftpsrv 正在运行，而且是以系统模块（switch_sysmod）的形式，而不是应用：应用只在自制程序菜单打开时运行，菜单一关就跟着退出。",
 "The module lives in /atmosphere/contents/420000000000011B/ — exefs.nsp, toolbox.json and an empty flags/boot2.flag. Enable it in an overlay (ovlSysmodules or uberhand).": "模块放在 /atmosphere/contents/420000000000011B/ ——exefs.nsp、toolbox.json，以及一个空的 flags/boot2.flag。请在浮层（ovlSysmodules 或 uberhand）里启用它。",
 "The same switches live in the toolbar and the View menu.": "同样的开关也在工具栏和“显示”菜单里。",
 "The saves match on every field we read": "我们读取的每个字段上两个存档都一致",
 "The signature is recomputed — otherwise the console rejects the file.": "签名会重新计算——否则主机不会接受这个文件。",
 "The signature is recomputed. The save name comes from the save itself, not from the file name.": "签名会重新计算。存档名取自存档本身，而不是文件名。",
 "The usual port is 21, anonymous login, no password.": "端口通常是 21，匿名登录，无需密码。",
 "The usual port is 5000. The sphaira app and the module take the same port — they cannot run together.": "端口通常是 5000。sphaira 应用和模块占用同一个端口——两者不能同时运行。",
